target/
.stellar/

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose. soroban-env-host 22.x declares
# ed25519-dalek with an unbounded `>=2.0.0` requirement, so without a
# lockfile cargo resolves ed25519-dalek 3.x which breaks the env-host
# testutils build (`ChaCha20Rng: ed25519_dalek::rand_core::CryptoRng`).
# The committed lockfile pins ed25519-dalek 2.2.0 and keeps CI builds
# deterministic. See the CI workflow (ci.yml -> Soroban contracts).
!Cargo.lock
